Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.93,0:00:10.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For crying out loud...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.86,0:00:14.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why is she telling us to cool our heads here for a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.23,0:00:18.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leaving us alone in a place like this \Nwon't be any trouble for us anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.87,0:00:21.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Being forbidden to use alchemy—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.15,0:00:23.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it's like when we were training here that one time, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.86,0:00:28.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you think that maybe Sensei doesn't feel like we've made any progress at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.20,0:00:29.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That couldn't be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.03,0:00:39.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just a minute! Al! Ed!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:42.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't get so upset. \NYou'll fall in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.98,0:00:44.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.70,0:00:47.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.67,0:00:49.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is a good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.95,0:00:50.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.94,0:00:52.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't just "yeah" me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.91,0:00:55.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't understand the reason why you're leaving the two of them
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.60,0:00:57.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,on an uninhabited island \Nall of a sudden!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.31,0:00:58.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.81,0:00:59.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.29,0:01:04.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Jeez! What in the world \Nare you thinking?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.00,0:01:05.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is good to do \Nevery now and then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.30,0:01:10.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's nice to stop and think things over once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.70,0:01:13.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's something those two need to do right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.96,0:01:21.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man cannot obtain anything \Nwithout first sacrificing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.68,0:01:26.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In order to obtain anything, \Nsomething of equal value is required.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.97,0:01:31.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is alchemy's \NLaw of Equivalent Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.71,0:01:37.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the time, we believed that \Nto be the true way of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.45,0:03:22.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.11,0:03:23.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Should we run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.80,0:03:27.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't! \NAfter all, I can't swim!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.58,0:03:29.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, \Nneither can I.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.28,0:03:34.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right. We're not \Nthe same as we used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.40,0:03:36.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.59,0:03:46.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is fun, huh, Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.06,0:03:51.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure is. It's been a long time since \Nwe've been out sightseeing like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.39,0:03:53.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sightseeing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.58,0:03:55.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's rich!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.98,0:04:08.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here, take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.66,0:04:12.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A knife?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.97,0:04:14.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is an uninhabited island, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.78,0:04:19.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No electricity, no wells, no houses to shelter you from the rain,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.43,0:04:22.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and no wild animals... at least, probably not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.98,0:04:28.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For one month, you two are to \Nsurvive by yourselves on this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.36,0:04:32.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, and during that time, \Nthe use of alchemy is prohibited.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.79,0:04:36.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.72,0:04:39.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll come to pick you up \Nin one month.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.68,0:04:41.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,J-Just a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.05,0:04:44.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One is all, all is one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.72,0:04:48.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you don't find \Nthe answer in one month,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.11,0:04:50.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sending you \Nback to Resembool.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.52,0:04:51.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.25,0:04:59.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One is all, all is one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.39,0:05:04.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We understand it now, \Nbut at the time...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.11,0:05:09.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. We didn't have a clue \Nwhat she was saying—not at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.73,0:05:25.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One is all, all is one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.20,0:05:28.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good grief, that auntie has given us homework that doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.76,0:05:31.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One is all, all is one. \NWhat could it mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.92,0:05:36.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it a riddle? \NI don't get it at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.27,0:05:40.95,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,But unless we give her an answer in a month, \Nwe won't get any real training.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.01,0:05:48.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aw, jeez! How is this supposed to be alchemy training?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.00,0:05:50.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That auntie tricked us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.77,0:05:54.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.22,0:05:59.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How about we get up early tomorrow and find some food?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.82,0:06:00.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.93,0:06:28.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al? You going to the bathroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.73,0:06:46.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it, Brother? You can use the bathroom by yourself...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.44,0:06:48.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You idiot! Open your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.72,0:06:59.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.41,0:07:05.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've gotta be kidding! \NIf we run, then our training will be—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.71,0:07:07.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.20,0:07:11.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.89,0:07:22.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.21,0:07:38.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.48,0:07:39.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.77,0:07:40.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.41,0:07:42.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.95,0:08:05.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now what? \NDon't get lost on me, Al...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.74,0:08:10.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't taste good!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.15,0:08:12.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, it's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.56,0:08:16.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al! Thank goodness! \NI thought I'd lost you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.84,0:08:35.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a fox.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.74,0:08:39.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, there's two of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.30,0:09:13.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.05,0:09:22.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've got dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.08,0:09:25.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Make sure to dry off, \Nor else you'll rust.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.79,0:09:26.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.71,0:09:31.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who was that man?! I'm scared! I'm scared to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.06,0:09:33.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And she said there were no wild animals here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.41,0:09:36.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's something even worse than wild animals here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.09,0:09:38.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.48,0:09:40.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What can we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.34,0:09:43.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's another month before they're coming for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.26,0:09:47.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For the time being, we can't fight on empty stomachs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.16,0:09:49.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.40,0:09:51.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've got food!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.28,0:09:54.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can catch it with \Nthe right kind of trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.98,0:09:56.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.90,0:09:59.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How do we eat it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.33,0:10:02.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We stick it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.63,0:10:03.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We stick it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.21,0:10:16.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll have to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.76,0:10:21.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No! Brother, you do it! \NI've never killed an animal before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.53,0:10:23.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Neither have I!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.16,0:10:26.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not fair! You always force me to do the things you don't want to!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.12,0:10:27.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.19,0:10:32.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.27,0:10:35.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're not getting away from us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.73,0:10:43.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.08,0:10:49.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you okay? \NYou're hurt pretty bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.45,0:10:51.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That damned fox!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.99,0:10:59.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where'd he go? That bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.23,0:11:01.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.46,0:11:10.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It has children.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.59,0:11:13.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder if she's their mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.46,0:11:14.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.06,0:11:23.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's give up on meat \Nand go for fish...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.96,0:11:41.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder if you can eat fox...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.81,0:11:43.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.01,0:11:45.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Got one!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.66,0:11:47.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.11,0:11:48.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Food!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.99,0:11:51.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We humbly partake!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.68,0:12:14.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.91,0:12:27.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.00,0:12:27.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.88,0:12:28.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.39,0:12:30.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.24,0:12:30.60,Dialogue Alt,,0,0,0,,Ow-ow-ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.94,0:12:33.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.60,0:12:35.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't give me "what is this?"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.33,0:12:38.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't dig right in just \Nbecause you're hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.26,0:12:39.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It wasn't me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.51,0:12:40.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.61,0:12:42.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your handprint is right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.06,0:12:43.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take a close look.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.69,0:12:45.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is a right hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.92,0:12:48.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure enough, someone's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.41,0:12:50.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here? You don't mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.62,0:12:56.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's possible that Sensei brought them here for the same reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.58,0:12:59.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.64,0:13:03.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go check around. We'll find something to eat while we're at it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.16,0:13:16.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no way we're giving up! Twenty-eight more days!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.44,0:14:07.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.50,0:14:12.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What did we come here for, again?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.14,0:14:13.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Beats me...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.71,0:14:34.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What would happen \Nif we died here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.08,0:14:36.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.94,0:14:39.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Winry and Grandma \Nwould grieve for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.49,0:14:43.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's still a lot of \Nthings I want to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.88,0:14:48.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All of this... What does it \Nhave to do with alchemy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.69,0:14:51.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've had enough! \NI want to go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.58,0:15:02.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.45,0:15:04.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.88,0:15:14.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I found some food for Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.19,0:15:19.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.56,0:15:21.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come look!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.57,0:15:25.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother? I wonder what's the matter...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.58,0:15:26.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You called, Al?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.82,0:15:28.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.07,0:15:29.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then who was that just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.46,0:15:48.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.85,0:16:08.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A cicada?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.54,0:16:10.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I get it...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.61,0:16:13.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's dead...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.31,0:16:18.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Death...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.41,0:16:21.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When you die,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.88,0:16:24.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}this is what happens...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.94,0:16:41.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let go of Al...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.44,0:16:47.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let go of Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.12,0:17:17.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We talked about what would happen if we died here, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.87,0:17:21.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm. Everyone would grieve.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.32,0:17:24.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um, that's the subjective part.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.68,0:17:26.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looking at it objectively,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.25,0:17:31.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,if I died, the world would keep on going \Nas if nothing had happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.08,0:17:32.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your existence is a tiny one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.82,0:17:34.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't call me small!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.01,0:17:35.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ee-yow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.62,0:17:41.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, if I, with my small existence, \Nwere to die, my body would still remain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.19,0:17:44.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Water, carbon, ammonia, lime,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.34,0:17:49.97,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,phosphorous, saltpeter, salt, sulfur, magnesium, fluorine, manganese, and aluminum, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.97,0:17:50.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.92,0:17:55.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That and a handful of other elemental compounds are all that I am, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.72,0:17:57.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My body, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.22,0:18:01.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After all, I'm fated to be \Nbroken down by bacteria
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.60,0:18:04.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and become nourishment for plants.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.25,0:18:09.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But then those plants will raise grazing animals...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.38,0:18:13.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And the grazing animals will feed carnivorous animals...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.03,0:18:17.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Without even being aware of it, we naturally go on circulating.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.66,0:18:20.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.95,0:18:26.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's a giant flow that \Nwe can't see with our eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.68,0:18:30.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whether you call it the universe, or the world, I don't know,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.83,0:18:36.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but, Al, you and I are one little part within the larger flow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.32,0:18:38.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One within all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.34,0:18:42.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, all of the ones have to \Ncome together for the all to exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.63,0:18:47.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The world follows the flow of \Ngreater laws that we can't even imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.25,0:18:51.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We learn that flow, \Nbreak it down, and reconstruct it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.28,0:18:55.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And that's alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.13,0:19:00.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thirty days!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.59,0:19:02.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've got breakfast!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.76,0:19:06.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It is the appointed day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.60,0:19:09.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One is all, all is one. \NLet's hear your answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.92,0:19:11.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"All" is the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.75,0:19:12.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"One" is me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.44,0:19:25.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.03,0:19:27.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll move on to real training.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.63,0:19:30.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.73,0:19:37.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess that guy isn't here after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.40,0:19:42.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's okay, isn't it? We more or less got what Sensei was trying to tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.59,0:19:43.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.56,0:19:44.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Back then,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.33,0:19:47.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we arrived at the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.41,0:19:52.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But still, that alone wasn't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.80,0:19:56.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The truth is, back then,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.82,0:20:00.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we should have realized that \Ntransmuting Mom was a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.27,0:20:07.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It could be that everything \Nwe're about to do is, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.35,0:20:11.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Sensei would agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.80,0:20:28.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you remembered?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.87,0:20:30.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.34,0:20:31.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you realize it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.31,0:20:37.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um, Sensei, what you're trying to tell us is...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.01,0:20:40.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's true that we did try to transmute our mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.16,0:20:43.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The way we are now \Nis the outcome of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.76,0:20:48.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, that is precisely why \Nwe want to get everything back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.76,0:20:52.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You intend to get back through error that which you lost through error?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.92,0:20:57.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe it is wrong of us...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.57,0:20:59.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.78,0:21:01.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,if that's the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.62,0:21:03.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,what are we supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.69,0:21:08.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're going to move forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.79,0:21:10.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We are...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.39,0:21:13.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,still alive, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.61,0:21:17.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And that's enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.42,0:21:18.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.57,0:21:22.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.57,0:21:24.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is someone there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.94,0:21:26.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.86,0:21:29.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hasn't someone been living on this island since long ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.89,0:21:32.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You think it could be that \Nmasked man from before?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.64,0:21:36.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That couldn't be. \NThe reason being, that was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.55,0:21:40.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What do you mean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.79,0:21:43.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just in case, I had him keep watch, since I couldn't let you die on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.57,0:21:45.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,S-So then...!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.28,0:21:49.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Apparently, that doesn't \Nseem to be the case here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.83,0:23:40.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fullmetal Alchemist{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.57,0:23:43.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Episode 29: "The Untainted Child"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.57,0:23:47.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, I saw it—
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.84,0:23:51.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the old scar on his shoulder.
